{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eJLpZMoA6W1793145473.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>乒乓總會訓練中心正式啟用，目標培育新一代接班人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TT.OPEN-2100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oOVOkFwk1g1793145477.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>香港乒乓代表黃鎮廷表示︰「我小時候真的沒有那麼多資源，環境也沒有那麼優秀。所以現在有這樣的條件，包括我們剛剛也參觀了幾個球室，其中一個是有一些比較高科技的器材，可以去分析、去看自己的一些(打球)線路，怎樣可以再加強自己的技術，這些我覺得對他們的幫助都比較大。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TT.OPEN-2100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zpBaamkoIG1793145475.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>總會主席余國樑，總教練李靜，榮譽顧問、前國家代表張怡寧等主持開幕儀式。黃鎮廷與陳顥樺落場，親身體驗訓練館的設備。張怡寧就與小朋友合照。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TT.OPEN-2100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261PIshCO2B91793145471.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>位於沙田的訓練中心由乒總自行營運，是首個專業訓練基地，設有三個訓練館，發球機及「鷹眼」訓練系統等，目標是為具潛質球員，提供更優質的訓練，培育港隊新一代接班人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JS.TT.OPEN-2100_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Yl1hB8bfc61793145469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:33.050136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T21:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:38.115800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:58:34.090651+00:00","content_hash":"87f11ab30cb0ac2e6d295a9f3eece4e359b3efd32baddd6f50d96d45616544a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:33.050136+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}